  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1013.02 Control and Protection Settings. An application proposing to use a configuration or operating mode to limit the export or import of electrical power across the PCC shall include proposed control or protection settings.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
